    "preamble": "Mikkilineni Rajesh, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh., on 28 January, 2020 Author: J. Uma Devi Bench: J.Uma Devi The Hon'Ble Ms.JUSTICE J.Uma Devi Criminal Petition No.398 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioners/ A-1 and A- 2, seeking to quash the proceedings dated 01.01.2020, in Crime No.04 of 2020 of Chandarlapadu Police Station, Krishna District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 418, 420, 269, 270, 272 r/w 34 of I.P.C and Section 5(1) of Cigarettes and other Tobacco Products (Prohibition, Advertisement and Regulation of Trade and Commerce, Production, Supply and Distribution) Act, 2003. The case on hand has also been filed questioning the proceedings in Crime No.149 of 2019, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 418, 420, 269, 270, 272 r/w 34 of I.P.C and Section 5(1) of Cigarettes and other Tobacco Products Act, 2003.",
